            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hgr"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These are easier when formed into a roll and then sliced with a cheese slicer, and I like to increase the amount of spices.",
            "datePublished": "2022-04-11T00:47:58.501Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "3"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Brad R"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Not as spicy as I was hoping. Looking for a Sweetzel/Ivins ginger snap type recipe.\n\nDough is very loose but once you pack it, roll it and chill it, it cuts very easily.",
            "datePublished": "2012-06-09T04:35:16.097Z"
          },
          {
