              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LParker"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very yummy. almost as good as the ones you can get from Old Salem =]",
            "datePublished": "2011-12-19T09:38:28.803Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "badbin"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great recipe... the spices are just right, and the crispy texture is great. I used coconut oil instead of shortening, and reduced the chilling time to an hour. The dough is quite sticky, so I used plenty of flour to roll and a plastic spatula to lift the cookies. Family and friends loved these... I will definitely make them again!",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-05T10:38:04.333Z"
          }
